{"title": "Otiluke's Resilient Sphere (Condition)", "pageid": 16588, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Otiluke's_Resilient_Sphere_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Otiluke's Resilient Sphere</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The affected creature is enclosed in an arcane sphere and can neither be damaged by attacks or effects from outside the sphere, nor can it damage anything outside the sphere. The affected creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is halved. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" t